arious weapons, equipment and magical items\nExtensive multiplayer fun with companion and competitive matches over LAN and EarthNET\nRevolutionary graphics taking full advantage of Per Pixel Shader technology with automatic adaptation of the engine to fitted hardware\nA brand new Musical Score with over 75 pieces of original music\nCompletely 3D with a freely rotating camera", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/knightshift", "videos": [{"id": 143080, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "KaLS_pVBL-Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KaLS_pVBL-Y", "title": "Once Upon A Knight 2003", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KaLS_pVBL-Y/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 143883, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "Uqu2HfguHnQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Uqu2HfguHnQ", "title": "KnightShift (2003) - PC Gameplay / Win 10", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Uqu2HfguHnQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 13049, "name": "Polanie"}]}